    },
    {
        "text": "]",
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Dear, would you look at that. Isn't that Sir Enciodes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_277_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Impossible. Tomorrow is the day of the Holy Hunt. The Master is surely preparing his offerings to the Saintess, so why would he be patrolling his territory so early in the morning?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, that really is Sir Enciodes!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_277_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard it used to be forbidden to ride burdenbeasts to Mount Karlan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Especially those seeking an audience with the Saintess. They had to keep their palms together, eyes on the ground, head bowed in prayer from the moment they left home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at the Master now. Does he intend to follow the old tradition?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_277_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, I've heard of that tradition before, but the Master... Even someone of his status intends to walk up the mountain one step at a time with his head bowed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_277_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you talking about? The Master is also a child of Kjeragandr. Don't tell me you're one of those Paleroche idiots who've forgotten the scriptures.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_277_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What kind of fool do you take me for? That's not what I meant!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner B"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just worried about the Master. You know as well as I do that the other two clans are insatiable. The Master proposed to return the Saintess to power, and they weren't too happy about that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner B"
    },
    {
        "text": "They are jealous of all the progress that the Master has brought, and even sabotaged one of our railways. I heard they're in bed together now, working to keep Kjerag sealed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_277_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They wouldn't dare. Resorting to violence right before Kjeragandr's eyes would anger Her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_277_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is there anything they wouldn't do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Today, the Master is walking through the streets unarmed. Tomorrow, the three clans will be sending their forces up to the mountains to hunt. What kind of blasphemy could they possibly commit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_277_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hush, you're going to invite misfortune if you keep talking like that! O Kjeragandr, please bless the Master with a safe journey!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_277_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "O Kjeragandr, please bless the Master with a safe journey!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_272_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enciodes, I didn't think we'd see any worshippers as devout as you in this day and age!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Noble"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_272_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_198_blackd_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "My apologies, Mr. Pale. The Master is participating in an important ceremony and has to pray all the way there, so he cannot answer you right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weiss"
    },
    {
        "text": "But allow me to offer you my regards on his behalf.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weiss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_272_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_198_blackd_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No worries, I am the one at fault. O Kjeragandr, please forgive me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Noble"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, the road from Turicum to Karlan is long, and I'm afraid that others will be worried if they see Enciodes like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Noble"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_272_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_198_blackd_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry. The Master made up his mind to do this long ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weiss"
    },
    {
        "text": "We will protect him all the way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weiss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_272_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_198_blackd_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's a relief. May Kjeragandr bless Silverash.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Noble"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_272_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_198_blackd_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "May Kjeragandr bless you as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weiss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
