    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_250_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1,
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It always feels like the beasts start panicking before the hunt even begins.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_250_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You can tell how the beasts are behaving just from looking out the window?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjarr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_250_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "From the shifting of the snow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_250_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That being said, make sure you watch your feet tomorrow on the day of the Holy Hunt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjarr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_250_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Great Elder is here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjarr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_250_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh. I have plenty of things to watch out for as it is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
