    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you ready, Enya?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I've prepared my luggage and my speech.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, Great Elder, this isn't the first time I've done this ceremony.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This one will be unlike anything in the past.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard that Enciodes is coming to visit Kjeragandr.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's good that he's willing to show piety at a time like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "text": "Silverash also ordered a number of idols from the Vine-Bead Court not long ago, and enshrined them in places that lacked them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Did Enciodes really become so religious overnight?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Saintess, whether or not his devotion is true is for Her to judge. It is not our place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elder A"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, even those ignorant of Kjeragandr will be converted and pray to her after seeing a majestic aurora.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elder A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looking at things this way, to become devout overnight is actually a manifestation of Her power.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Elder A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Regardless of Enciodes's motivations, his conduct is beyond reproach.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "As long he upholds the faith with his actions, then there is nothing for you to be concerned about, Saintess.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the end, all the people of Kjerag must bow to thousands of years of tradition.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope so.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Enciodes aside, the other two clan leaders will head up the mountain and wait.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "text": "Since you will be accepting the transfer of power from the three clans, your speech will need to be more than just satisfactory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whether during the Holy Hunt or the ceremony itself, if you seem to display any sort of bias towards the three clans, people will immediately interpret that as a sign that a clan has gained or lost power.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand the significance of the bell that I hold, and have thought extensively about how to wield it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There's just one more thing, the hunting longbow. Please allow me to use it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Enya, you are familiar with the records of the previous Saintesses, and should know that the Saintess is not required to personally join the hunt. Were you planning to use this longbow at the ceremony initiating the Holy Hunt?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Although the Saintess is not required to personally join the hunt, it should not be an affront to Kjeragandr if she does so.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This has been the tradition in the Vine-Bead Court for thousands of years. You must not disregard your status, Saintess.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Saintess must accept the offerings of the three clans on behalf of Kjeragandr, bestowing food upon Kjeragandr's children in Her place during the ceremony.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What would it mean if the Saintess hunted the prey with her own hands?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, this isn't some kind of safari for your amusement.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right. In thousands of years, there has never been a precedent for the three clans to cede power to the Vine-Bead Court.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "The transfer of power was originally meant to be a peacekeeping measure, but these days, turmoil wells up beneath Mount Karlan, and the land meant to be handed to the Saintess is being senselessly torn apart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "As if they are not afraid to blaspheme Kjeragandr.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Kjeragandr's children need the Saintess to appease Her anger and show Her that the pious hearts of the people of Kjerag have not changed for thousands of years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe what Kjeragandr needs is a Saintess who will convey her wrath.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't invite ill omens within the temple.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And in addition, 'those who toil will hold power, and those who idle will suffer.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Though the three clans are supposedly ceding their power to the Saintess, it is not for the sake of handing over any true authority.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But in order to maintain the faith's standing, I cannot simply wait for the bounties of the three clans. I am not trying to portray them as incompetent, but rather leading by example.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If maintaining the faith's standing is what you care about, then it is impossible to speak of change.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Kjeragandr's children have already moved forward. The prayers they offer to Her are certainly different from what they were a thousand years ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "And surely, She is not responding to them the same way She did a thousand years ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
