    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard that the Master set off from the old Silverash estate early in the morning and walked all the way here on his two feet, without resting or taking even a single sip of water.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner C"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dad, let's fetch a bowl of water for him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "To follow the old ways, he cannot eat, drink, or sleep the entire way there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner D"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But... it's already been a whole day, dad. Our town is only halfway to Mount Karlan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner C"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's about to leave, and the sun's going to set too. Who knows what kind of dangers are out there in the snow...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, he's coming...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner D"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Silverash's team quietly passes through the street at dusk. Enciodes keeps his head bowed, his palms folded as he silently prays in the direction of Mount Karlan in the distance."
    },
    {
        "text": "Those who hear his footsteps peek out from the windows curiously, leave their doorways, or stand on both sides of the street."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_280_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_278_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Dad...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner C"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I can't get him some water to drink... then I want to follow him to the foot of Mount Karlan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner C"
    },
    {
        "text": "I decided to follow the Master when he opened a factory to teach me about technology. Now that he is demonstrating his faith and going to worship at Mount Karlan, that makes me want to follow him all the more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kjerag Commoner C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Without a word, the people stand up, go down the stairs, and follow the Silverash guards into the snow."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
